{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_38401","headline":"花村六韵 · 吴融","name":"花村六韵","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"地胜非离郭，花深故号村。\n已怜梁雪重，仍愧楚云繁。\n山近当吟冷，泉高入梦喧。\n依稀小有洞，邂逅武陵源。\n月好频移座，风轻莫闭门。\n流莺更多思，百啭待黄昏。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"吴融","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_38401.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_38401","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}